<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 96,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 96,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog receipts Monday were 96,000 head, compared with the estimate of 95,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts $1.00 per cwt higher compared to midsession Monday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    58.00 -59.00	   59.00 -60.00</p>
<p>few			57.50  59.50	   58.50  60.50</p>
<p>Sows:  steady to $2.00 higher.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  44.00 -47.00	   44.00 -48.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   46.00 -49.00	   47.00 -50.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    50.00 -53.00	   50.00 -54.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
